Given input \(x = [1, 1]\):

Hidden pre-activations:
\[
z_1 = W_1 x + b_1 =
\begin{bmatrix}
1 & 0.5 \\
0.5 & 1
\end{bmatrix}
\begin{bmatrix}
1 \\ 1
\end{bmatrix}
+
\begin{bmatrix}
0 \\ 0
\end{bmatrix}
=
\begin{bmatrix}
1.5 \\ 1.5
\end{bmatrix}
\]

Hidden activations with ReLU:
\[
a_1 = \text{ReLU}(z_1) =
\begin{bmatrix}
1.5 \\ 1.5
\end{bmatrix}
\]

Output:
\[
\hat{y} = W_2 a_1 + b_2 =
\begin{bmatrix}
0.5 & 1
\end{bmatrix}
\begin{bmatrix}
1.5 \\ 1.5
\end{bmatrix}
+ 0
= 0.5(1.5) + 1(1.5)
= 2.25
\]

So:
- \(z_1 = [1.5, 1.5]\)
- \(a_1 = [1.5, 1.5]\)
- Output \(= 2.25\)
